@*
    The governments, which are what an empire ends up called.

    Nobody picks one of these either. The game takes the highest-weighted government whose
    conditions the design meets, which is how an empire becomes a Divine Empire rather than a
    Despotic Hegemony - so the weight is half of every answer, and the conditions are the other
    half. What each one calls its ruler and its heir is the reason to come looking.

    The second address is one entry of the shelf, as on every other page here.
*@

<PageTitle>Governments - Stellaris Empire Manager</PageTitle>

<WikiSection Kind="WikiKind.Governments" Focus="@Key" />

@code {
    /// <summary>The entry the address names, where it names one.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string? Key { get; set; }
}
